OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 12, dies after car hit by
OL,4,Atrain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 12-year-old boy has died after a car
OL,7,Fwas hit by a train at a level crossing
OL,8,Fin County Mayo.
OL,10,FGardai (Irish police) and emergency
OL,11,Fservices responded to reports of a
OL,12,Fcollision involving a train and a car
OL,13,Fin Kiltybo near Ballyhaunis at about
OL,14,F20:45 local time on Thursday.
OL,16,FA passenger in the car, a 12-year-old
OL,17,Fboy, was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FThe driver, a man in his late 40s, was
OL,19,Ftaken by ambulance for hospital
OL,20,Ftreatment but his injuries are not
OL,21,Flife-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
